languages/japanese/ is SOURCE TEXT, not a translation target.
It is the original Japanese text of SSP and, together with
languages/english/, one of the two source languages that every
other language pack is translated from.

  * Do not edit, translate, sync, rename or "fix" anything here
    as part of a translation job. Source text changes are made by
    the maintainer only.
  * Do not copy this folder to create another language.
  * This folder is not a language pack: it is not built, not
    linted and not released (see .not-shipped).

